BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:sigdial-2026-conference@scientific-conference-calendar
DTSTAMP:19700101T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260802
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260806
SUMMARY:SIGDIAL 2026 · Conference
DESCRIPTION:Annual Meeting of the Special Interest Group on Discourse and D
 ialogue\nStatus: confirmed\, checked 2026-10-31\nOfficial source: https:/
 /2026.sigdial.org/\nVenue Radar: https://gon-uri.github.io/venue-radar/#s
 igdial-2026\nNotes: 27th meeting at Emory University\, Atlanta\, Aug 2-5\
 , 2026 (Aug 2 workshops/tutorials\, Aug 3-5 main)\, fully in person\; mov
 ed in Feb 2026 from July 13-17 for the World Cup. CFP deadlines are 23:59
  AoE. Title/abstract registration on Apr 13 was mandatory\; only the PDF 
 could change until Apr 20. ARR commitment (May 25) was for already-review
 ed papers. Long (8p)\, short (4p) and demo papers\; proceedings in the AC
 L Anthology. The chairs' preface reports 61 of 134 accepted (45.5%). Size
  M (about 60 papers a year\; attendance not published). Size is an editor
 ial estimate.
