  only controls the Nov 12 short papers. A Demonstrations call posted Oct 
 27 (four-page paper plus video\, in the proceedings\, due Dec 27 AoE) is 
 not tracked as a separate route. The AAAI fast track is limited to highly
  rated AAAI-27 papers and is not a general new-paper route. Size XL is an
  editorial estimate. Historical acceptance covers main full papers only\,
  not Blue Sky Ideas or the newly introduced 2027 Findings track.
CATEGORIES:Machine Learning,Reinforcement Learning,Autonomous Agents & Mult
 iagent Systems,Human-AI Interaction & Deployment
URL:https://warwick.ac.uk/fac/sci/dcs/aamas2027/
LOCATION:Hanoi\, Vietnam
END:VEVENT
